    cache_v2_first_milestone_known_gaps_2026-08-10, 0, "Doc Status OPEN - recorded, not fixed; only C1/C3/A3/C7 landed; admission.spl and lease.spl present in tree"
    cache_v2_first_milestone_known_gaps_2026-08-10, 1, "Triage 2026-11-04: gaps 1 (placeholder-v0 abi/semantic/link digests, module_identity.spl:19-20), 5 (6h lease fallback, lease.spl:50) and 6 still present; gap 3 fixed. Correction: lease.spl EXISTS at src/compiler/80.driver/cache/lease/lease.spl (the 2026-08-17 ABSENT note was path drift). Gap 4 partly moved: disk_cache_bound_v1.spl and HIR free-space admission landed in Oct but admission.spl:96-98 still scopes min_free_ratio to the cache budget with no host free-bytes rt symbol. This is a milestone ledger, not one defect: keep open as tracking; QUESTION: close it and file gaps 1/2/4/5 as separate rows?"
    cache_v2_first_milestone_known_gaps_2026-08-10, 2, "2026-11-05 w3: gap 5 CLOSED - lease.spl reclaims only on proven owner death, no 6h fallback (dead LEASE_STALE_TIMEOUT_SECS const deleted; lease_liveness_reclaim_spec pins it). Gaps 1, 2, 4, 6, 7 remain; ledger stays open."
    cache_v2_first_milestone_known_gaps_2026-08-10, 3, "2026-11-09 lane-p2-3: closed milestone ledger (not one defect). abi_interface_digest is now real; gaps 1 (semantic/link placeholder digests), 2 (ApiSurface generics/effects/modes), 4 (host free-bytes) tracked as TODO markers in module_identity.spl, compile_interface.spl, admission.spl; gap 5 closed 2026-11-05; gaps 6/7 are plan/verification items."

